Welcome to Axolotl Adventures!!

This game is designed to let you the player play as an axolotl and travel from different location and grow. You get to start the game choosing what axolotl you would like to be and swim into the underground cave. Level up to unlock new locations, but watch out for the emeries. Collect xp by completing different levels and get faster swimming.

Axolotl Types
    * Brown/Tan
    * Golden Albino
    * Albino
    * Leuciastic
    * Xanthic
    * Melanoid

These locations include:
    * Lakes
    * Pounds
    * Underwater Caves

Enemy
    * Herons
    * Large Fish

Health/ XP
    * eat food (worms, shrimp, etc..)
    *Complete Levels